{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1741478400, "end_date": 1742083199, "month_true_total": 1156, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:28:19 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "190304272", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119832640", "personaname": "我要弄伤你的鳞片了", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nogoodnolife/", "num_games_owned": 2593, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 3173, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2765, "last_played": 1748609335, "avatar": "5e3480f8a78ca213e13bf7c0dd87360381d3ad27"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "一个付费游戏，大半的装备内容是放在各种蓝币包里面的，而且蓝币包不能通过正常的刷图获得，只能通过舔图一次获得十来二十个，一个蓝币包要1000。正常途径要玩到这游戏里的正常内容，比打工还打工。蓝币包买到了，里面的东西要勋章，依然很难获得，还有上限250个，你要解锁一个蓝币包的所有东西，依然还得像打工一样攒勋章。。\n\n这游戏要正常体验大多数内容，要么比刷手游还肝，花大量无意义时间去刷蓝币，要么直接给他充钱，充值买币。吃相相当难看。\n\n当然你也可以开挂去刷，但是开挂并不是正常手段，当然也不会影响我正常的给他差评", "timestamp_created": 1742077714, "timestamp_updated": 1742077714, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501311540603637695", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190303278", "author": {"steamid": "76561198216622885", "personaname": "云鹤Un/H0", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198216622885/", "num_games_owned": 203, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 31821, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3017, "playtime_at_review": 25798, "last_played": 1788002675, "avatar": "dd6e550faaaa4db8e45349de3deb7272597f0ca6"}, "language": "schinese", "review": " 傻逼箭头你有几个妈就把追踪虫变体做成普通单位？\n这是一款难度崩坏的游戏：怪物以无甲轻甲重甲被划分为三道不可逾越的鸿沟，不用对应穿透能力的武器几乎造成不了任何伤害，场景破坏也对武器有对应的要求，所以前期的体验是相当糟糕的，没有强力武器无异于炮灰，低级怪五六下致死，中级两下，高级怪直接秒杀，中难高难几乎就相当于要求无伤，怪物性能一个比一个逆天，潜兵和纸糊的人一样挨不了两下还动不动变布娃娃\n换弹无反馈，有时换弹被打断了都不知道要用时捉急，动作慢得吓人、操作不跟手，手柄键位逆天，部分交互只有A能打断而B不行，交互改成X多人房间还会冲突\n债券解锁缓慢，两个债券价格超过游戏价格，而没有债券配装被大大限制\n这原本是一个差评，但为何发了这么多牢骚后还是好评了呢？（划去）因为尽管游戏性不足但画面确实没得喷，而且启动速度很快。无需加速器即可匹配到天南海北的玩家们（不限国界）有些国外玩家的素质真的高，不仅耐心带萌新，而且很有代入感，是真的把自己当做一名为传播民主而奋斗的绝地潜兵，团结、奋斗、永不言弃。这还是我第一次边玩游戏边查单词，只为更好的交流，天南海北的、世界各地的、不论国籍、肤色、性别、信仰等等的人们，都在游戏里化为绝地潜兵，一同战斗、感受这国际的友谊。\n成为一名绝地潜兵、成为一名国际的战士，为地球而战\n傻逼游戏，每次打字都要卡摇杆\n又在幻想了，碰到几个好大哥就幻想这游戏玩家素质可以了，低能儿也不少\n（超级气球是头猪*）\n充斥着低能怪物设计的弱智游戏", "timestamp_created": 1742076852, "timestamp_updated": 1785850652, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190284735", "author": {"steamid": "76561199015008262", "personaname": "拖延症晚期", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199015008262/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 662, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 453, "last_played": 1742477947, "avatar": "993b2be1ff114a5f757333ed05bab7b726c421b1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "LAJI", "timestamp_created": 1742063164, "timestamp_updated": 1742063164, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190280434", "author": {"steamid": "76561199518669280", "personaname": "日服第一太刀侠礼奈", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199518669280/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 26976, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5, "playtime_at_review": 19625, "last_played": 1787663191, "avatar": "f83fc33fe07ecce4df0f4e3d721cf5b5e0abce3f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "箭头，你母亲什么时候去世啊，想把瑞典打造成人类之光的梦想破灭了吧，全世界潜兵都是好样的，荣耀属于我们，超级地球是头猪", "timestamp_created": 1742060161, "timestamp_updated": 1748471847, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190276849", "author": {"steamid": "76561199566272564", "personaname": "Sign", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199566272564/", "num_games_owned": 150, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 11322, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4762, "last_played": 1786120551, "avatar": "5fb6559d72aa24191116e2de2e849b3830b69025"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不错", "timestamp_created": 1742057652, "timestamp_updated": 1742057652, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}